{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;It's like Bop-It mixed with the OG asteroid shooter game&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through space alone or with a friend as you escape the alien threat with scrambling controls. To help, your ship slows everything around you at the expense of energy. If your energy ever runs out before you complete a level, it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903010/extras/de308f80268b52a80a71cb4bd751a8de.poster.avif?t=1765919502\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903010/extras/de308f80268b52a80a71cb4bd751a8de.webm?t=1765919502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903010/extras/de308f80268b52a80a71cb4bd751a8de.mp4?t=1765919502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level contains multiple grids that you need to complete in order to complete a level. At the end of each grid, you'll regain some energy. If you ever die, time rewinds to allow you to retry the grid, but at the cost of energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game's Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ levels of increasing complexity as you balance to navigate through the grid with ever changing controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score ranking system that tracks your best performances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An energetic and frantic soundtrack to match your scrambling thoughts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenging and rewarding experience by yourself or with a friend</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against a friend in 8+ levels based around the skills learned in the single player/co-op mode</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903010?t=1765919502","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903010?t=1765919502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903010/df5a7224feab14054a29e43a76dc4a609bf77e0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765919502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903010/df5a7224feab14054a29e43a76dc4a609bf77e0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765919502","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4052650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;It's like Bop-It mixed with the OG asteroid shooter game&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through space alone or with a friend as you escape the alien threat with scrambling controls. To help, your ship slows everything around you at the expense of energy. If your energy ever runs out before you complete a level, it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903010/extras/de308f80268b52a80a71cb4bd751a8de.poster.avif?t=1765919502\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903010/extras/de308f80268b52a80a71cb4bd